        154.83555252100842,
        371.4042093230404,
        720.6313319327733,
        11.646678147268403
      ],
      "text": "This Order is made under the Safeguarding Vulnerable Groups Act 2006 (c. 47) (\u201cthe 2006 Act\u201d). ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/XWULEF+Times-Roman",
        "size": 10.5600004196167
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        154.83557836134455,
        386.1583660926366,
        720.6313060924371,
        11.646678147268403
      ],
      "text": "This Order provides for the activity of removal of saliva or mucus from the mouth or nose of an ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/XWULEF+Times-Roman",
        "size": 10.5600004196167
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        154.83557836134455,
        400.91251068883616,
        720.6328220588235,
        11.646678147268403
      ],
      "text": "individual where that is done for the purpose of testing an individual for coronavirus, not to be ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/XWULEF+Times-Roman",
        "size": 10.5600004196167
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        154.83555252100842,
        415.66659441805234,
        720.6315386554622,
        11.64675118764842
      ],
      "text": "treated as a regulated activity within the meaning of the 2006 Act. The provision made by Article ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/XWULEF+Times-Roman",
        "size": 10.5600004196167
